invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: ch_connect stops holding the offer to CH_ALPN_MAX entries, so a
  longer list passes the config check and the ClientHello grows past
  CH_HELLO_MAX. A count over 255 would also put the server's selection
  outside the uint8_t ch_tls.alpn_selected reports it in.
  bin/webpki_session_test's count boundary rows object.

--- old
    if (cfg->alpn_count == 0 || cfg->alpn_count > CH_ALPN_MAX) {
--- new
    if (cfg->alpn_count == 0) {
